## 2. Major Decisions Require Author Consultation (重大决策需与作者协商)

Before making any of the following major decisions, you **must first discuss
the decision with the original author (Akiro) and obtain their explicit
approval**:

- (a) Renaming the Software or presenting it under a different product name;
- (b) Releasing a modified, forked, or derivative version as a **commercial
  product** sold for profit;
- (c) Re-licensing or sub-licensing the Software under a different license
  for redistribution;
- (d) Using the Software or its derivatives as the core of another product
  brand without attribution.

> 在作出以下任何重大决策之前，你**必须先与原作者（Akiro）讨论并获得其明确同意**：
> - (a) 重命名本软件或以其它的产品名称发布；
> - (b) 将修改版、分叉版或衍生版本作为**商业产品**出售牟利；
> - (c) 以其它协议重新授权或再授权本软件用于再分发；
> - (d) 在未署名的情况下，将本软件或其衍生品作为其它产品品牌的核心。

Personal use, learning, non-commercial reference, and private modification do
**not** require prior consultation, provided that the attribution condition in
Section 1 is still honored.

> 个人使用、学习、非商业参考和私有修改**无需**事先协商，但仍须遵守第 1 条的署名要求。

